2:T414,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/traxart-explainer-voiceover#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/traxart-explainer-voiceover","headline":"Traxart Explainer Video Voiceover ","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/traxart-explainer-voiceover","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Guy Harris provided a clean, natural voiceover for Traxart's new explainer video. Click on the link to watch the ad and listen to Guy's voiceover.","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/traxart-explainer-voiceover.jpg"}}3:T454,<h2>A Clean, Natural Voiceover Style for Traxart</h2>
<p>Even with my <a href="/santa-voice" target="_blank" title="Santa Voiceover">Santa voiceover</a>, <a href="/david-attenborough-voice" target="_blank" title="David Attenborough Voiceover">David Attenborough voice</a>, and my range of <a href="/character-voiceover" target="_blank" title="Character Voiceover">character voiceovers</a>, it's this natural style that I'm asked to do most of all, especially for <a href="/explainer-video-voice" target="_blank" title="Explainer Video Voiceover">explainer videos</a> where clarity is even more important. If you're not sure exactly what an explainer video is, I'd say that it is just a longer advertisement that tries to explain an idea or a complex product. For more information, check out my <a href="/what-is-explainer-video-voiceover" target="_blank" title="What is an Explainer Video Blog">What is an Explainer Video Blog</a> Given that Traxart is all about giving feedback on presentations, clarity was even more important in this case! I'm really pleased with the result and I think they are too!</p>7:["slug","traxart-explainer-voiceover","d"]
0:["-I7cAKaR5Wzfc67K4RiE3",[[["",{"children":[["slug","traxart-explainer-voiceover","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"traxart-explainer-voiceover\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","traxart-explainer-voiceover","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/traxart-explainer-voiceover#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Traxart Explainer Video Voiceover \",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/traxart-explainer-voiceover\"}]}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Traxart Explainer Video Voiceover "}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Another natural voiceover on a high-quality explainer video</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main one-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],false,false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/traxart-explainer-voiceover.jpg","alt":"traxart-explainer-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A Little More About Traxart</h2>\r\n<p>Traxart, as you can tell from the explainer video, is quite a unique company as it has created an app that allows a presentation's audience to offer feedback and comments on every aspect of a presentation. There's so much more to it than that, but the explainer video captures the essence of this innovative brand's product. Traxart's tagline is \"We’re here to remove the guesswork out of understanding presentation performance.\" and I'm sure this is an invaluable tool for individuals and companies who regularly give presentations. This is a brand-new company, so I hope the explainer video helps them connect with their customers.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you have product that needs a little more explanation, then perhaps you'd benefit from an explainer video like this one I voiced for Traxart. Check out my <a href=\"/michelin-cross-climate-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Michellin Cross-Climate Tyres\">Michellin Cross-Climate Tyres</a> explainer videos to get a better idea of what I can do. Or perhaps you're not looking for an explainer video and you'd like to check out my <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceovers</a> instead. Whatever your voiceover needs, do get in touch</a> and tell me what you're looking for. I'm always happy to take on new work and I can usually record voiceovers on the same say they're requested!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Traxart Explainer Video Voiceover ","pageUrl":"traxart-explainer-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"